static const char _zs233_d[] = "no native implementation\n\nA declaration says `is native` -- that the backend supplies its body -- and the backend has none for it. The program is wrong, not the compiler: write the body, or give the runtime the build uses an implementation of it. Checked at the declaration, whether or not anything calls it.";
